# ─── AgentShield Environment Variables ───────────────────────────────────────
#
# Pick ONE of the free API providers below.
# GitHub Models is preferred (Microsoft ecosystem, free with GitHub account).
#
# ── Option 1: GitHub Models (RECOMMENDED — free, Microsoft/Azure AI Foundry) ──
# Get your token: https://github.com/settings/tokens → Generate new token (classic) → no scopes needed
GITHUB_TOKEN=your_github_personal_access_token_here

# ── Option 2: Groq (free tier, very fast, Llama 3.1) ─────────────────────────
# Get your key: https://console.groq.com/
# GROQ_API_KEY=your_groq_api_key_here

# ── Option 3: OpenRouter (free models available) ──────────────────────────────
# Get your key: https://openrouter.ai/
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=your_openrouter_api_key_here

# ── Note: Pattern-only mode ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# If no API key is set, AgentShield still works using its 60+ pattern database.
# LLM deep analysis will be skipped but detection remains highly effective.
